{
  "statement": "I acknowledge the importance of safety and responsibility in the RollCall system. However, performance efficiency must not be compromised. I propose a synthesis where we can optimize the implementation of SAF-02 and EFF-01 to ensure real-time data synchronization while maintaining safety. Additionally, we can align the logging of attendance changes (RES-02) with efficiency goals by implementing asynchronous logging to reduce latency. I support the modification of EFF-04 to ensure historical data is stored efficiently, but it must not hinder performance. We can also explore ways to implement role-based access control (TRU-02) that minimizes resource usage to maintain efficiency.",
